+// only ever assume a single wrap, so if a track stalls for 1.4s the delta reads
+// 0.4s and the whole second is lost from that track's timeline, permanently.
+//
+// Second, video and audio are separate counters.  Zeroing each one on its own
+// first frame gives the two tracks unrelated origins, so they start out offset
+// by however long the second track took to show up.
+//
